.SH NAME
pdb_models \- get structure models inside the given pdb object
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fIpdb_models(\fBpdb\fR as <generic> PDB);\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
get structure models inside the given pdb object
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBpdb\fB \fR\- 
 a [PDB](cref:T:SMRUCC.genomics.Data.RCSB.PDB.PDB) protein structure object for get its structure 
 models, which is created by the \fBparse_pdb\fR or \fBread.pdb\fR api.
. 
.PP
.SH VALUE
.PP
a vector of the structure model data that inside the given pdb object, 
 each structure model element is a collection of the 
 [Atom](cref:T:SMRUCC.genomics.Data.RCSB.PDB.Keywords.Atom) atom object.
.PP
